 3 \\cdot (-4) - 6 \\cdot (-2) \\\\\n&= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $\\det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA = \\mid \\,0\\, \\mid = 0\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186268923 17592186268924 17592186268925 17592186268926 17592186268927 17592186268930 17592186268931 17592186268932 17592186268933 17592186268934 17592186268937 17592186268946 17592186268947 17592186275588 17592186275589 17592186275590 17592186275591 17592186275592 17592186279112 17592186289222] "immutable_fields" [[17592186268922 :answer-field/correct] [17592186268922 :answer-field/id] [17592186268922 :answer-field/key] [17592186268922 :answer-field/type] [17592186268929 :answer-field/correct] [17592186268929 :answer-field/id] [17592186268929 :answer-field/key] [17592186268929 :answer-field/type] [17592186268936 :answer-field/correct] [17592186268936 :answer-field/id] [17592186268936 :answer-field/key] [17592186268936 :answer-field/type] [17592186268945 :answer-field/correct] [17592186268945 :answer-field/id] [17592186268945 :answer-field/key] [17592186268945 :answer-field/type] [17592186275587 :answer-field/correct] [17592186275587 :answer-field/id] [17592186275587 :answer-field/key] [17592186275587 :answer-field/type] [17592186279111 :answer-field/correct] [17592186279111 :answer-field/id] [17592186279111 :answer-field/key] [17592186279111 :answer-field/type] [17592186289221 :answer-field/correct] [17592186289221 :answer-field/id] [17592186289221 :answer-field/key] [17592186289221 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
